spans.s:
आधा॑न n. placing, adding, causing, producing;
 depositing,
deposit, pledge;
 receptacle, enclosure;
 also = अग्न्याधान &
गर्भाधान q.v.

अ॑धर a. lower;
 अधरं कृ subdue, अधरः पद् be
subdued. m. the lower lip, coll. the lips.

आधार॑ m. support, basis (l.&f.);
 receptacle, canal;
(g.) province, sphere (of an action).

अधरोत्तर a. lower and higher, inferior and better,
losing or winning;
 confuse, topsy-turvy^1. n. state of confusion;
 address
and answer.
[1] Correction submitted by AnnaRybakovaT, Jim Funderburk. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/25.

अध॑स् adv. below, down;
 अधोऽधस् deeper and deeper. With
कृ put low, despise;
 w. पत् sink down. As prep. under, below, w.
acc. (also अधोऽधस्), gen., abl., & —˚.

अध॑स्तात् adv. down, on the ground, from below;
 humbly,
submissively;
 prep. underneath, below (gen., abl., or —˚).

अधस्पद॑ a. being under the feet;
 ˚पद॑ कृ tread
upon, subdue. n. the place under the feet, as adv. under foot.
